<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14354] Regression when using SELECT (EXISTS (...))</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14354</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This worked as expected in 2.9.1:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
CREATE TABLE t (i &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; PRIMARY KEY, j &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;);
SELECT (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM t WHERE t.i = 1));&#160;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In version 2.10, I&apos;m getting:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
SQL Error [1001] [42000]: Failed to parse query. Column &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;EXISTS1&quot;&lt;/span&gt; not found; SQL statement:
SELECT
(EXISTS1)
FROM SYSTEM_RANGE(1, 1) __Z0 
 LEFT OUTER JOIN PUBLIC.T __Z1 
 ON __Z1.I = 1 [42122-197]&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The workaround is to project an asterisk:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
SELECT (EXISTS (SELECT * FROM t WHERE t.i = 1));&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
